Z||000005||cifc||08-08-2000||07:20 PM||||Sorry about the link.  I don't know how to post one.  The guy with the red 88 really knew how to drive.  Wish he'd show me.  The car had a roll bar and a lot of engine and suspension mods.  I think it was mostly a race only car.  There was another fiero out there with a 4.3 and it was totally gutted.  He said he took 55 lbs out of each door.  All he had left was the outer skin and the handles.  It was a new engine though, and the doesn't have it all worked out yet.||||reg||1
